        "text": "The audience values official perspectives from elected officials and regulatory leaders.",
        "confidence": 0.91
      },
      {
        "text": "Washington DC is a central location for key decision-making in financial regulation.",
        "confidence": 0.9
      },
      {
        "text": "The credibility of the speakers is enhanced by their formal titles and institutional affiliations.",
        "confidence": 0.89
      },
      {
        "text": "Listeners expect structured introductions before expert discussions on financial topics.",
