    "turn_file": "/shared/3/projects/podcasts/transcriptionQueue/turns/pol_appearance_episodes_interviews/9/7/97266.jsonl",
    "turn_idx": 6,
    "turn_text": "So I'm, as you can see, kind of an old guy and pretty boring, and I don't have a Twitter account, and I don't have a Facebook account, but even looking in the so-called mainstream press, it seems like Washington is polarized to an unprecedented extent these days. And so there's been a lot of change in Washington. What's your perspective on the environment, what it's like serving in Congress now compared to maybe how it was when you were first elected? What are the things that are actually fun",
