    "turn_text": "Yeah, I think it's gonna be a tough election. For sure, to me, it's going to be the most difficult election I've had. I'm not one of these to cry wolf. I've got colleagues who do every single year as the race of their lives. To me, I've been really fortunate. I have a great district. They call it R plus five. So it leans Republican. It was drawn by Democrats in Springfield to the",
